	+ For example, add a maximum token count and abort the operation if exceeded, returning an error instead.
	+ Example fix snippet (assuming a max token limit of 100):
```c
if (i >= 100) { // Check against max token limit
  for (int j = 0; j < i; j++) {
    free(result[j]);
  }
  free(result);
  free(copy);
  return NULL; // Return error due to max limit exceeded
}
```

